{"unit_id":"Rice00__dsh-loupe#card-zh","repo":"Rice00/dsh-loupe","commit":"9c0003830d731749aca9b02d4ae7b36ba45d1241","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loupe（DSH 网页插件）：选中对话中的词句，即可在浮窗查看模型解释。它接入宿主 webServer，提供流式回答、连续追问、历史搜索和上下文编辑，也能把对话保存为正式会话。适合阅读 DSH 对话时快速理解内容，并将有价值的解释留存；可调整邻近消息数量、上下文长度、推理档位和界面语言。插件使用宿主模型服务，并在本机保存上下文与问答历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:528","lib/index.js:1218","lib/index.js:1021"]}
{"unit_id":"Rice00__dsh-loupe#card-en","repo":"Rice00/dsh-loupe","commit":"9c0003830d731749aca9b02d4ae7b36ba45d1241","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-loupe is a DSH web plugin that explains selected conversation text in a floating window. It uses the host web server and model service for streamed answers and follow-up questions. Users can search local history, edit plugin context, and save useful exchanges as regular sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:528","lib/index.js:1218","lib/index.js:1021"]}
